  quarantineExitLines:
  - You have GOT to be out of your mind, I swear!
  - FINE! But on the record, this is completely WRONG!
  killExitLines:
  - "Of all the small-minded, cowardly\u2026!"
  - "You better hope\u2026 I don't come back\u2026 as a ghost\u2026 pal\u2026"
